SEARCH","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"The world of technology is changing. It used to be one where users could post on social media, order clothes online, and play mobile games without a care in the world. As time progressed, companies eventually realized that they could collect small pieces of information from a user\u2019s technological habits, and use that to form a profile of the user of some sort. I used a packet-monitoring service to listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":2191,"global_rank":198358},{"name":"onecrayon/Soft-Spoken.kiwitheme","owner":"onecrayon","html_url":"https://github.com/onecrayon/Soft-Spoken.kiwitheme","stars":2,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"An unassuming theme for Kiwi.app, inspired by Tweetie","topics":[],"score":2190,"global_rank":198363},{"name":"fpotter/mixpanel-cappuccino","owner":"fpotter","html_url":"https://github.com/fpotter/mixpanel-cappuccino","stars":2,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"Some helpers for integrating Mixpanel with Cappuccino","topics":[],"score":2190,"global_rank":198364},{"name":"krzysz00/cl-trees","owner":"krzysz00","html_url":"https://github.com/krzysz00/cl-trees","stars":2,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"A library for trees of various types in Common Lisp","topics":[],"score":2190,"global_rank":198367},{"name":"74hc595/remona","owner":"74hc595","html_url":"https://github.com/74hc595/remona","stars":2,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"A symbolic remote monitor/debugger for 8-bit computers","topics":[],"score":2190,"global_rank":198370},{"name":"adriangodong/alexa-lambda-handler","owner":"adriangodong","html_ur